  "level": "- **L4**: WebSocket gateways, a message store, offline delivery via push; knows ordering matters.\n- **L5**: sequence numbers per conversation, idempotent sends, ack-after-durable-write, connection registry, group fan-out strategy, presence throttling, numbers for connections per gateway.\n- **L6**: multi-region routing and data placement, encryption's consequences for features, reconnect storms and capacity planning, product trade-offs (history vs privacy)."
